  Description: 'USE IS PERMITTED ONLY WITH THE PERMISSION OF YOUR WAREHOUSE SUPERVISOR 
    Pharmacological action: the drug has a neuromuscular effect on the body, has
    a stimulating effect on the arm muscles, and blocks myostatin. Contraindications:
    Magnesium deficiency, increased muscle content in the body. Administration: Inject
    the drug into the neck or into the veins of the arms and press the button to
    deliver the fluid into the body.'
